  THE CLASS CLOSURE, stated as cells: {0, 7} accepted and 8 refused at widths 1, 2, 4, 8 -- 12 cells, all rowed:
    0: sb W, sh W, sw W, sd W            7: sb W, sh W, sw W, sd A            8: sb W, sh W, sw P (r0), sd W
  Each new cell has its own one-edit target (T_W_*), so the closure is MEASURED, not asserted.

GUARD FIELD vs BODY FIELD, SIBLING PARITY: unchanged from PRETABLE.out -- the fix's code is unchanged.
CLAIM -> ROW for the one edited comment sentence ("stored as an int ... 9 made the next DATA access end the emulator
... 0x100000003 selected port 3"): history, carried by M_revert -- K HOST-DIED at its DATA read, and P's 0x100000003 row
reads 0x3 (table 2's M_revert.raw; table 3's M_revert.raw will say the same or this sentence is wrong).

PREDICTIONS FOR ALL 62 (mutants549_t3.py):
  RED: every M_* except M_static and M_noguard; every T_* except T_D9c_serial1; N_clobcell, N_clobcmd, N_cmdport,
    N_cmdread, N_datarearm, N_rdlatch, N_rdmask3, N_rearm, N_runcmd.
  M_revert (HEAD's arm verbatim), predicted 47/73 with CONTROL=OK: red = P's nine keeps + tail + both counts +
    first value (13), R x2 (HOST-DIED at its DATA write), K x3 (HOST-DIED), F x3 (count, lw reads 9, value), W x5
    (refuse 8 by sb/sh/sd, bit 63 alone -> reads 0, previous 6 -> reads 9).  V predicted GREEN on HEAD: every refused
    value there stays a legal port or is never followed by a DATA access with it selected.
  PREDICTED 73/73, each DISCLOSED in the contract: M_static (one fbctrl per -E session), M_noguard (unreachable on a
    correct PORT arm), T_D9c_serial1 (serial 1 under -E), N_acc32 (the fix's own binary, measured by the Opus seat),
    N_order (layout only), N_rdmask7 (selector always 0..7), N_datard16 and N_datawr8 (DATA-path widths, out of
    scope: every DATA value the probe writes fits in 8 bits).
FLOOR: (a) HEAD fails (M_revert, predicted 47/73); (b) M_revert is HEAD's PORT arm verbatim at the one fixed site;
(c) the gate pins `rows run' at 73 and now RECONCILES the emitted rows with the trailer (Opus measured the row-deleted
fixture passing six checks without it); (d) the DEPENDS-ON predicates -- `writeflag == MEM_READ', `idata >= NPORTS',
`!d->warned_port' -- each have weakened/qualified forms in the table (M_gt M_u32 M_i32 M_i64 M_mod33 M_bit M_wide
T_D2 T_X_w8 T_W_* T_D7* M_reflatch M_acclatch T_D9a T_D9b M_latchcnt M_perval; N_rdlatch N_rdmask3 T_D6 on the read
arm); (e) the contract in the probe header.
